# What `vercel deploy` must never upload. .env.local holds the local trial's settings and admin
# password, and would override .env.production on the host. Every entry is anchored with a leading
# slash: a bare `tiles` also matched app/api/tiles and dropped the upload route from the build.
/.env.local
/.env.*.local
/.vercel
/node_modules
/.next
/maps
/tiles
/uploads
/.emulator-data
*.log
